{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Evidence basis for this plan (read-only investigation, 2026-08-29, no LLM calls):\n\nCorpus (fresh origin/tickets): 5,985 tickets; 1,283 with ≥1 plan-review sidecar; 4,317 sidecars in tree (14 v1, 4,303 v2), PASS 2,329 / BLOCK 1,821 / INDETERMINATE 167, 2026-06-27→08-29; impact cohorts plan-v5 2,117 / v4 1,520 / v3 662 / v2 16; ~4,988 REVIEW_RESULT files pruned from the tree, ~40% plan-review by sample, all recoverable from git history. LMN store: 515 tickets, 31 with reviews, 74 sidecars (all v2, plan-v5, Bedrock Sonnet). 946 tickets with ≥2 reviews; 2,483 consecutive changed-material pairs (BLOCK→PASS 788, BLOCK→BLOCK 847, PASS→PASS 569); 551 identical-material pairs of which 208 flipped verdict. Labels: plan_defect bug closes 84, caused_by links 89, plan-PASS→completion-FAIL 199 tickets, reopens 18 (of 21) on reviewed tickets. Plan text reconstruction: 3,768 of 4,317 reviews predate their ticket's latest SNAPSHOT, so EDIT replay from git history is required; the stored material_fingerprint (material_diff.material_basis) verifies the reconstruction exactly.\n\nPipeline seams: Pass 3 is deterministic (review_kernel/decide.py) and fully replayable from sidecar findings[].verification + block_threshold + blocking_enabled (proven by docs/calibration/plan_v5_rescore.py). Pass 2 is a pure function with injectable run_chunk (review_kernel/verify.py); the verifier eval spec lacks a run_case arm. Pass 1 needs live Opus. Sidecars do not persist prompts, raw responses, pass-2 analysis text or pass-1 affirmations.\n\nCost (from .rebar/usage.jsonl, 11,902 rows, priced with genai-prices Bedrock ids: Opus 4.8 $5.5/$27.5, Sonnet 4.6 $3.3/$16.5 per M): median full review $4.82 uncached (finders $3.44, verifier-agentic $0.53, overlap judge $0.13, decide $0); p90 $10.83; pre-2026-08-12 with caching $2.18. Prompt caching has been 0% since 08-12 (mixed Bedrock+Anthropic chain → prompt_cache_style none) — filed as bug paternal-repayable-flamingo. $200 ≈ 40 full reviews uncached / ~90 cached, ~375 Pass-2-only re-runs, ~2,000 single-criterion single-turn calls, unlimited Pass-3 replays. usage.jsonl rows carry no ticket id (runner reads ticket_id, producers write ticket_ids) — child bug undamaged-adept-xenarthra.\n\nPrior art honoured: ADR 0054 (field corpus is the instrument) and epic pastoral-aquatic-viper's rejection of live A/B batches; existing harnesses under docs/experiments/plan-review-gate/harnesses/ and docs/calibration/ are the starting point for corpus.py and tier0.py."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788029527544602796,"uuid":"5d518a97-01ee-463d-8eb7-6af64618c8d5"}